     D major (2 sharps), 4/4. Measure 5 changes to F major (1 flat) mid-system. Measure 9 returns to D major and opens a system (print new-system). Measure 11 changes key to A major (3 sharps) and time to 3/4 together. Notes that test the accidental judgement: F natural and B flat at measure 5 (both in the new key, so no sign), B natural at measure 6 (needs a natural against F major), F sharp at measure 9 (in the restored key, so no sign), F natural at measure 10 (needs a natural against D major). One lyric syllable per note. -->
